      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SAKO (1) has a strong record this trip with three wins and five placings from nine starts. Scored by 8 lengths last time (29.54) in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. HER INDULGENCE (4) was a strong winner (29.94) from box 7 last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths at this track. Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Leading chance again. BANK KEEPING (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 29.79 beating Tempest Tiger. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Must be included in calculations. STOMP SHUFFLE (3) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
